This repository contains:
- An Unraid plugin (`unraid-r8127-driver.plg`) — GPL-2.0
- Build scripts to compile the Realtek r8127 OOT driver — GPL-2.0
- Pre-compiled `.txz` packages distributed via GitHub Releases — GPL-2.0
  (the underlying r8127 driver source is published by Realtek under GPL-2.0
  and is not included in this repository; the build script fetches it from
  https://github.com/SzilagyiDaniel/Unraid-r8127 at build time)

The plugin layout and naming are derived from the upstream
SzilagyiDaniel/Unraid-r8127 plugin (also GPL-2.0).
